The Mission: The user acts as a bank robber trying to open a digital vault. Ask them to input a single 5-digit integer pin (e.g., 84215). The vault only opens if the PIN meets a strict set of security rules.

The Rules:
* The first digit must be even.
* The last digit must be odd.
* The sum of the second and third digits must perfectly equal the fourth digit.
* The entire 5-digit number must be a multiple of 5.

If all conditions are met, print "VAULT OPEN". If even one fails, print "ALARM TRIGGERED" and tell them exactly which rule they failed first.
